iv>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Zzaion\">Zzaion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace\">Zao Palace</a> and its <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace%20Antechambers\">antechambers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a> (in fort), <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Zao%20Plantations\">Northern Zao Plantations</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey like to stay at a distance and use their <a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spears</a> to attack. They run at 10 health or less.<br/><br/>A lizard legionnaire attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b>: These Lizards keep their distance, making it hard to kill them with melee since chasing it will lure you into more of them. Try to trap them somewhere to save supplies. <b>Mages</b> are recommended to bring <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle\">icicle</a> runes in order to reach them efficiently and Lightning can come in real handy for <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">sorcerers</a></b>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 111,269 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-165</td>\n<td>62.5</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"94.082808\" style=\"text-align:center;\">94%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span c